ng dealt with in an assertion. As stated in <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter15-=
section4"/>, the default is the set of plausible alternatives. Thus if we s=
ay:</para>
+  <programlisting><anchor xml:id=3D"c15e5d1"/><anchor xml:id=3D"cll_chapte=
r15-section5-example1"/>5.1)   le stizu cu na'e xunre
+       The chair is a non-(red-thing).
