=80=9Ccats=E2=80=9D, <phrase role=3D"IPA">[z]</phrase> as in =E2=80=9Ccards=
=E2=80=9D, <phrase role=3D"IPA">[=CA=83]</phrase> as in =E2=80=9Ctension=E2=
=80=9D, or <phrase role=3D"IPA">[=CA=92]</phrase> as in =E2=80=9Cmeasure=E2=
=80=9D. The sound of Lojban =E2=80=9Cx=E2=80=9D doesn=E2=80=99t appear in m=
ost English dialects at all.</para>
