+     go'a      (repeats a previous bridi)
+     go'u      (repeats a long-ago bridi)
+     go'e      (repeats the last-but-one bridi)
+     go'o      (repeats a future bridi)
+     nei       (repeats the current bridi)
+     no'a      (repeats the next outer bridi)
+
+         bu'a-series:
+     bu'a      some-predicate-1 (rafsi: =E2=80=9Cbul=E2=80=9D)
+     bu'e      some-predicate-2
+     bu'i      some-predicate-3
+
+         others:
+     co'e      has the obvious relationship (rafsi: =E2=80=9Ccom=E2=80=9D/=
=E2=80=9Cco'e=E2=80=9D)
+     mo        bridi question
+     du        identity: x1 is identical to x2, x3 ... (rafsi: =E2=80=9Cdu=
b=E2=80=9D/=E2=80=9Cdu'o=E2=80=9D)
+</programlisting>
+</section>
+
+<section xml:id=3D"cll_chapter7-section18">
+  <title>18. Other cmavo discussed in this chapter</title>
